ication (DVWA) v1.10 *Development*</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<script src='/dvwa/js/add_event_listeners.js'></script>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t</body>\r\n\r\n</html>", "solution": "Ensure that the application/web server sets the Content-Type header appropriately, and that it sets the X-Content-Type-Options header to 'nosniff' for all web pages.If possible, ensure that the end user uses a standards-compliant and modern web browser that does not perform MIME-sniffing at all, or that can be directed by the web application/web server to not perform MIME-sniffing.", "solution_reference": "<p>https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/previous-versions/windows/internet-explorer/ie-developer/compatibility/gg622941(v=vs.85)</p><p>https://owasp.org/www-community/Security_Headers</p>"}
